  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening Asfamipaz Co 2012-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Asfamipaz Colombia 2012-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att st&#xf6;dja Asfamipaz arbete f&#xf6;r frisl&#xe4;ppande av poliser och soldater  kidnappats av FARC samt deras r&#xe4;ttigheter, och f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka deras   arbete f&#xf6;r en f&#xf6;rhandlingsl&#xf6;sning p&#xe5; den interna v&#xe4;pnade konflikten.  I projektet ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven psykologiskt st&#xf6;d till poliser, soldater och   deras familjer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Asfamipaz&apos; work for the release of policemen and soldiers     kidnapped by FARC and the rights of those released, and to strengthen their work for a negotiated solution to the internal armed conflict.  The project also includes psychological support to the policemen,     soldiers and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
